  "content": "<h2>ਕਦਮ-ਦਰ-ਕਦਮ ਗਾਈਡ: ਰੈਂਚਰ RKE2 ਅਤੇ ਲੌਂਗਹੋਰਨ</h2><div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"k8s-bg\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#E8EAF6\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#E3F2FD\"/></linearGradient><marker id=\"k8s-arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#326CE5\"/></marker></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#k8s-bg)\"/>PR XTAG014 ਆਰਕਚਰ (ਆਰਕੇਈ 2 ਅਤੇ ਲੋਂਗਹੋਰਨ) ਨਾਲ ਉਤਪਾਦਨ Kubernetes ਕਲੱਸਟਰ ਬਣਾਉਣਾ</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#326CE5\">ਕੰਟ੍ਰੋਲ ਪਲੇਨ ਨੋਡਜ਼</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਨੋਡ 1 (ਲੀਡਰ)</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"112\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">API ਸਰਵਰ</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"138\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">etcd</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"164\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">ਸ਼ਡਿਊਲ ਨੰਬਰ <text x=\"115\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\"> 30X30</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"112\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"265\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">API ਸਰਵਰ</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"138\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"265\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">etcd</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"164\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"265\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">ਕੰਟਰੋਲਰ Mgr</text><rect x=\"350\" y=\"80\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਨੋਡ 3</text><rect x=\"362\" y=\"112\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">API Server X44<rect x=\"362\" y=\"112\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/> API Server ਆਦਿ X4<rect x=\"362\" y=\"112\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/></text><rect x=\"362\" y=\"164\" width=\"106\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#5C8EE6\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">ਕੰਟਰੋਲਰ Mgr</text><text x=\"630\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">ਵਰਕਰ ਨੋਡਜ਼</text><rect x=\"530\" y=\"80\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਵਰਕਰ 1</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"112\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">ਕੁਬੇਲੇਟ</text><rect x=\"542\" y=\"138\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">kube-ਪ੍ਰੌਕਸੀ X6TAG6X X6TAG6X Poxy X6TAG6X<rect x=\"670\" y=\"80\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਵਰਕਰ 2</text><rect x=\"682\" y=\"112\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">kubelet</text><rect x=\"682\" y=\"138\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">kube-ਪ੍ਰਾਕਸੀ</text><rect x=\"682\" y=\"164\" width=\"96\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">ਪੋਡਜ਼</text><line x1=\"480\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"530\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#326CE5\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#k8s-arrow)\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"230\" width=\"500\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFA726\" stroke=\"#E65100\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਨਹਿਰ (CNI3X Pod-CNICD) ਨੈੱਟਵਰਕ (CNId Pod-Conal)<line x1=\"265\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#FFA726\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"/><line x1=\"590\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#FFA726\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"310\" width=\"500\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#7E57C2\" stroke=\"#4527A0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਲੌਂਗਹੋਰਨ ਡਿਸਟਰੀਬਿਊਟਿਡ ਸਟੋਰੇਜ ਲੇਅਰ</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"310\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#k8s-arrow)\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#616161\" font-style=\"italic\">HA ਸੰਰਚਨਾ 3 ਕੰਟਰੋਲ ਪਲੇਨ ਨੋਡਸ ਅਤੇ ਆਟੋ-ਫੇਲਓਵਰ</text></svg></div><h3>ਕਦਮ 1: RKE2</h3>ਨੂੰ ਸਥਾਪਿਤ ਕਰੋ<ol><li>ਅਧਿਕਾਰਤ ਰੈਂਚਰ ਵੈੱਬਸਾਈਟ ਤੋਂ RKE2 ਇੰਸਟਾਲਰ ਨੂੰ ਡਾਊਨਲੋਡ ਕਰੋ।</li><li>ਹਰੇਕ ਨੋਡ 'ਤੇ<code>curl -sfL https://get.rke2.io | sh -</code>ਚਲਾਓ।</li><li>RKE2 ਸੇਵਾ ਸ਼ੁਰੂ ਕਰੋ:<code>systemctl enable rke2-server &amp;&amp; systemctl start rke2-server</code></li></ol><h3>ਕਦਮ 2: ਸਟੋਰੇਜ਼</h3><div style=\"margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"lh-bg\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#F3E5F5\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#E8EAF6\"/></linearGradient><marker id=\"lh-arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#7E57C2\"/></marker>ਲੰਬੀ</defs>XTAG19 STAG19 XTAG19 ਵਿਤਰਣ ਵਿੱਚ ਲੋਂਗਹੋਰਨ ਨੂੰ ਤੈਨਾਤ ਕਰੋ</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"145\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਐਪ ਪੋਡ A</text><text x=\"145\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">PVC ਦਾਅਵਾ</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਐਪ ਪੋਡ B</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">PVC ਦਾਅਵਾ</text><rect x=\"420\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#k8s-bg)\"/> ਐਪ <rect x=\"420\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/> <rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#k8s-bg)\"/> <rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#k8s-bg)\"/> ਐਪ <rect x=\"420\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/> <rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#k8s-bg)\"/> <rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#k8s-bg)\"/> ਦਾਅਵਾ</text><rect x=\"610\" y=\"55\" width=\"130\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#326CE5\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"675\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">StatefulSet</text><text x=\"675\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#BBDEFB\">PVC ਦਾਅਵਾ</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"140\" width=\"400\" height=\"55\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#7E57C2\" stroke=\"#4527A0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਲੋਂਗਹੋਰਨ CSI ਡਰਾਈਵਰ &amp; ਇੰਜਣ</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#E1BEE7\">ਵਾਲੀਅਮ ਸਮਾਂ-ਤਹਿ &amp; ਪ੍ਰਤੀਕ੍ਰਿਤੀ ਪ੍ਰਬੰਧਕ</text><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"315\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"485\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"675\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"230\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਵਰਕਰ ਨੋਡ 1</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"268\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">ਪ੍ਰਤੀਕ੍ਰਿਤੀ A1 &amp; B1</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"300\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#81C784\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"318\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">SSD ਸਟੋਰੇਜ਼</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"332\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"347\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">iSCSI ਟਾਰਗੇਟ</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"230\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਵਰਕਰ ਨੋਡ 2</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"268\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">ਪ੍ਰਤੀਕ੍ਰਿਤੀ A2amp; C1</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"300\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#81C784\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"318\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">SSD ਸਟੋਰੇਜ</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"332\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"347\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">iSCSI ਟਾਰਗੇਟ</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"230\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4CAF50\" stroke=\"#1B5E20\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">ਵਰਕਰ ਨੋਡ 3</text><rect x=\"555\" y=\"268\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#66BB6A\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">ਪ੍ਰਤੀਕ੍ਰਿਤੀ B2amp; C2</text><rect x=\"555\" y=\"300\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#81C784\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"318\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\">SSD ਸਟੋਰੇਜ਼</text><rect x=\"555\" y=\"332\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#A5D6A7\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"347\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1B5E20\">iSCSI ਟਾਰਗੇਟ</text><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#7E57C2\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#lh-arrow)\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"295\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"295\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#616161\" font-style=\"italic\">XTAG190 <line x1=\"500\" y1=\"295\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"295\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"/> <text x=\"400\" y=\"390\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#616161\" font-style=\"italic\"> ਲਈ ਹਰੇਕ ਵੌਲਯੂਮ ਵਿੱਚ X9X3 ਦੀ ਪ੍ਰਤੀਰੂਪਤਾ ਦੀ ਕੋਈ ਉੱਚ ਸਮਰੱਥਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ</svg></div><ol><li>Helm ਸਥਾਪਿਤ ਕਰੋ:<code>curl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/helm/helm/master/scripts/get-helm-3 | bash</code></li><li>ਲੋਂਗਹੋਰਨ ਰੈਪੋ ਸ਼ਾਮਲ ਕਰੋ:<code>helm repo add longhorn https://charts.longhorn.io</code></li><li>ਲੋਂਗਹੋਰਨ ਸਥਾਪਿਤ ਕਰੋ:<code>helm install longhorn longhorn/longhorn --namespace longhorn-system --create-namespace</code></li></ol><h3>ਆਰਕੀਟੈਕਚਰ ਡਾਇਗ੍ਰਾਮ</h3><img src='/img/ai-neural-network.jpg' alt='Kubernetes Cluster Architecture Diagram' style='max-width:100%;margin:2em 0;'/><h3>ਤਕਨੀਕੀ ਨੋਟਸ</h3><ul><li>ਵਧੀਆ ਪ੍ਰਦਰਸ਼ਨ ਲਈ SSD ਸਟੋਰੇਜ ਦੀ ਵਰਤੋਂ ਕਰੋ।</li><li>ਯਕੀਨੀ ਬਣਾਓ ਕਿ ਸਾਰੇ ਨੋਡਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਵਿਲੱਖਣ ਹੋਸਟਨਾਮ ਅਤੇ ਸਥਿਰ IP ਹਨ।</li><li>Kubernetes ਪੋਰਟਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਮਨਜ਼ੂਰੀ ਦੇਣ ਲਈ ਫਾਇਰਵਾਲਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਕੌਂਫਿਗਰ ਕਰੋ।</li></ul><h3>ਕਿਵੇਂ ਕਰੀਏ: ਕਲੱਸਟਰ ਹੈਲਥ</h3>ਦੀ ਪੁਸ਼ਟੀ ਕਰੋ<pre><code>kubectl get nodes\nkubectl get pods -A\nkubectl get storageclass</code></pre><h3>ਵਧੀਆ YouTube ਵੀਡੀਓ ਗਾਈਡਜ਼</h3><ul>ਸ਼ੁਰੂਆਤ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਿਆਂ ਲਈ<li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bhBSlnQcq2g' target='_blank'>Kubernetes ਟਿਊਟੋਰਿਅਲ [TechWorld with Nana]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VnvRrz9fK_U' target='_blank'>Kubernetes ਪੂਰਾ ਕੋਰਸ - 8 ਘੰਟਿਆਂ ਵਿੱਚ Kubernetes ਸਿੱਖੋ | Kubernetes ਟਿਊਟੋਰਿਅਲ | Edureka</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vw1h8ZNmFvA' target='_blank'>ਰੈਂਚਰ RKE2 Kubernetes ਕਲੱਸਟਰ ਸੈੱਟਅੱਪ [ਰੈਂਚਰ ਲੈਬਜ਼]</a></li>Kubernetes ਲਈ<li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qn3jYj8pQjA' target='_blank'>ਲੌਂਗਹੋਰਨ ਸਟੋਰੇਜ [ਨਾਨਾ ਦੇ ਨਾਲ TechWorld]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PH-2FfFD2PU' target='_blank'>Kubernetes ਨੂੰ 15 ਮਿੰਟਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਸਮਝਾਇਆ ਗਿਆ [ਅਕੈਡਮੀਂਡ]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7bA0gTroJjw' target='_blank'>Kubernetes ਨੈੱਟਵਰਕਿੰਗ ਡੀਪ ਡਾਈਵ [Google ਕਲਾਉਡ ਟੈਕ]</a></li>Kubernetes ਲਈ<li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qn3jYj8pQjA' target='_blank'>ਲੌਂਗਹੋਰਨ ਸਟੋਰੇਜ਼ [ਨਾਨਾ ਦੇ ਨਾਲ TechWorld]</a></li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KqvK5K3nR6A' target='_blank'>Kubernetes ਸੁਰੱਖਿਆ ਵਧੀਆ ਅਭਿਆਸ [TechWorld with Nana]</a></li></ul><h3>ਵੀਡੀਓ ਵਾਕਥਰੂਜ਼</h3><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/bhBSlnQcq2g' title='Kubernetes Setup Demo' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/VnvRrz9fK_U' title='Kubernetes Full Course' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vw1h8ZNmFvA' title='Rancher RKE2 Kubernetes Cluster Setup' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qn3jYj8pQjA' title='Longhorn Storage for Kubernetes' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/PH-2FfFD2PU' title='Kubernetes Explained in 15 Minutes' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/7bA0gTroJjw' title='Kubernetes Networking Deep Dive' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/KqvK5K3nR6A' title='Kubernetes Security Best Practices' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe><h3>ਵਾਧੂ ਸਰੋਤ</h3><ul><li><a href='https://rancher.com/docs/rke2/latest/pa/' target='_blank'>ਰੈਂਚਰ RKE2 ਅਧਿਕਾਰਤ ਦਸਤਾਵੇਜ਼</a></li><li><a href='https://longhorn.io/docs/' target='_blank'>ਲੋਂਗਹੋਰਨ ਸਟੋਰੇਜ ਅਧਿਕਾਰਤ ਡੌਕਸ</a></li><li><a href='https://kubernetes.io/docs/home/' target='_blank'>Kubernetes ਅਧਿਕਾਰਤ ਦਸਤਾਵੇਜ਼</a></li></ul><h3>ਆਮ ਮੁੱਦੇ ਅਤੇ ਟ੍ਰਬਲਸ਼ੂਟਿੰਗ</h3><ul><li>ਨੋਡ ਸ਼ਾਮਲ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੋ ਰਿਹਾ: ਫਾਇਰਵਾਲ ਅਤੇ ਟੋਕਨ ਦੀ ਜਾਂਚ ਕਰੋ।</li><li>ਲੋਂਗਹੋਰਨ ਪੌਡ ਨਹੀਂ ਚੱਲ ਰਹੇ: ਸਟੋਰੇਜ ਕਲਾਸ ਅਤੇ ਨੋਡ ਲੇਬਲਾਂ ਦੀ ਪੁਸ਼ਟੀ ਕਰੋ।</li><li>ਨੈੱਟਵਰਕ ਮੁੱਦੇ: CNI ਪਲੱਗਇਨ ਕੌਂਫਿਗਰੇਸ਼ਨ ਦੀ ਸਮੀਖਿਆ ਕਰੋ।</li></ul>",
